# Folder-sync conflict copies. This repo lives under a synced directory, and the
# syncing service occasionally writes "name 2.ext" alongside a file that was
# edited — stale snapshots that `git add -A` will happily commit. They are never
# wanted, and one was once committed before being noticed.
